      "writtenOn": "2019-02-26T21:31:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my testing, this call to reset won\u0027t change the selected_rp array on a fresh plug-in since the previous charge manager bitmap will match the current one.  So yes, pd_power_supply_ready will be the one actually changing selected_rp and the call to set cc later will set 3.0 A Rp if only one dongle is connected.",
