      "message": "We can set it safely here because we\u0027re in Attached.SRC and Vconn is on so we shouldn\u0027t hit issues with CCD detection.\n\nHaving said that, I don\u0027t know how important this step really is.  Any PD port partners are allowed to disregard the Rp level and draw whatever current we advertised in our source capabilities.  So this clause is really only needed for non-PD port partners that need 3.0 A.  I don\u0027t know how common of a scenario that is.",
